'''SemperFi Esports''' is an [[:Category:Australia|Australian]] esports organization founded in July 2024.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3
|content1=
*July 28th - '''SemperFi Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with the signing of a roster consisting of [[SaVage]], [[Valiance (Australian player)|Valiance]], [[keen]], [[shadiy]], and [[vision]]. <ref name="1st roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/1817258301723402363|title=Introducing the SemperFi CS2 Team, and at the helm is @BenTheLegendCS|date=2024-07-28|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*March 5th - '''SemperFi Esports''' sign [[Kingfisher]] as the team's coach. <ref name="+kingfisher">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/1897309730672099468|title=@SaVagecs_ was pretty sick so has been in bed all day|date=2025-03-05|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>
