*March 14th - '''SemperFi Esports''' sign [[aliStair]]. <ref name="+ali">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/semperfiesc/status/1900404145817084179|title=Please join us in welcoming @aliStair_CS to the SemperFi roster!|date=2025-03-14|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 22nd - [[Kingfisher]] steps down from '''SemperFi Esports'''. <ref name="-kingfisher">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Kingfisheroce/status/1958763802045956155|title=Made the very difficult decision to step away from the @semperfiESC project and shift my focus to 5th year psych study|date=2025-08-22|author=[[Kingfisher]]}}</ref>
* September 3rd - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[aliStair]]. <ref name="-alistair">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/aliStair_CS/status/1963046454190383578|title=YA BOY IS A FREE AGENT|date=2025-09-03|author=[[aliStair]]}}</ref>
* September 6th - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[Valiance (Australian player)|Valiance]]. <ref name="-Valiance">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/1964186169882575184|title=We say goodbye to two veterans of Oz CS Alistair and Valiance|date=2025-09-06|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 7th - '''SemperFi Esports''' sign [[HaZR]] and [[ADDICT]]. <ref name="+hazr +addict">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/1964591266072842538|title=The best-kept secret in Aussie CS is out|date=2025-09-07|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 1st - '''SemperFi Esports''' sign [[Zyppe]] as the team's coach. <ref name="+zyppe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ZyppeCS2/status/2028048506498212017|title=I’m happy to be back on the server joining @semperfiESC|date=2026-03-01|author=[[Zyppe]]}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[ADDICT]] and acquire [[sliimey]] from [[Ground Zero Gaming]] as his replacement. <ref name="-addict +sliimey">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/semperfiESC/status/2051955753594814813|title=Roster update|date=2026-05-06|author='''SemperFi Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 7th - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[HaZR]] and [[sliimey]]. <ref name="-HaZR">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/hazr_cs/status/2063605312683471032|title=Quick update from me, I have decided to be parting ways with @semperfiESC|date=2026-06-07|author=[[HaZR]]}}</ref><ref name="-sliimey">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/sliimey1/status/2063511870292845040|title=I have had an amazing time playing with @semperfiESC|date=2026-06-07|author=[[sliimey]]}}</ref>
* June 29th - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[keen]]. <ref name="-keen">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/keen_CS2/status/2071613524422382005|title=After two unforgettable years, I've decided to part ways with SemperFi|date=2026-06-29|author=[[keen]]}}</ref>
* July 21st - '''SemperFi Esports''' part ways with [[shadiy]]. <ref name="-shadiy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/shadiyCS2/status/2079500315057942810|title=After 2 years, it's time to say goodbye to @semperfiESC|date=2026-07-21|author=[[shadiy]]}}</ref>
